---
title: "Dumpster Rental Pricing | JP Roll-Off Service"
description: "Real per-material dumpster pricing for 10–30 yard roll-offs. Construction debris from $550. 14-day rental included. Tonnage limits & terms listed. Call (301) 879-7040."
canonical: "https://jprolloff.com/pricing"
navActive: "/pricing"
quoteHref: "#quote"
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#fff;" data-en="Pricing" data-es="Precios">Pricing</span>
        <h1 data-en="Straightforward pricing — by size and material." data-es="Precios claros — por tamaño y material.">Straightforward pricing — by size and material.</h1>
        <p data-en="Prices below include delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Construction-debris containers include a set tonnage allowance; extra weight is billed per ton (see terms)." data-es="Los precios incluyen entrega, recogida y 14 días de renta. Los contenedores de escombros incluyen un límite de tonelaje; el peso extra se cobra por tonelada (ver términos).">Prices below include delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Construction-debris containers include a set tonnage allowance; extra weight is billed per ton (see terms).</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="price-table-wrap reveal" style="overflow-x:auto;">
          <table class="price-table" style="width:100%; min-width:760px; border-collapse:collapse;">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th style="text-align:left;" data-en="Material" data-es="Material">Material</th>
                {% for yd in pricing.sizeCols %}
                <th>{{ yd }} <small data-en="Yard" data-es="Yarda">Yard</small><br><span style="font-weight:500; color:var(--color-text-muted); font-size:var(--fs-12);">{{ pricing.tonnage[yd] }}</span></th>
                {% endfor %}
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for m in pricing.materials %}
              <tr>
                <th style="text-align:left;" data-en="{{ m.name.en }}" data-es="{{ m.name.es }}">{{ m.name.en }}</th>
                {% for yd in pricing.sizeCols %}
                <td style="text-align:center;">{% if m.prices[yd] %}${{ m.prices[yd] }}.00{% else %}<span style="color:var(--color-text-muted);">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
                {% endfor %}
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: var(--space-4); font-size: var(--fs-14); color: var(--color-text-muted);" data-en="Heavy aggregates (dirt, concrete, asphalt, granite) are available in 10, 15 & 20-yard only. Metal is a flat $275 at any size." data-es="Los agregados pesados (tierra, concreto, asfalto, granito) solo en 10, 15 y 20 yardas. El metal es $275 fijo en cualquier tamaño.">Heavy aggregates (dirt, concrete, asphalt, granite) are available in 10, 15 &amp; 20-yard only. Metal is a flat $275 at any size.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container container-narrow">
        <div class="section-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;"><div>
          <span class="eyebrow" data-en="The Fine Print" data-es="Los Detalles">The Fine Print</span>
          <h2 data-en="Rental terms & important guidelines" data-es="Términos de renta y guías importantes">Rental terms &amp; important guidelines</h2>
        </div></div>
        <ul class="feature-list" style="font-size: var(--fs-16);">
          {% for t in pricing.terms %}
          <li data-en="{{ t.en }}" data-es="{{ t.es }}">{{ t.en }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt" id="quote">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-band">
          <div>
            <h2 data-en="Not sure which size or material rate applies?" data-es="¿No sabes qué tamaño o tarifa aplica?">Not sure which size or material rate applies?</h2>
            <p data-en="Tell us what you're throwing out and we'll confirm the exact price." data-es="Dinos qué vas a desechar y confirmamos el precio exacto.">Tell us what you're throwing out and we'll confirm the exact price.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cta-band-actions">
            <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}" class="cta-band-phone">{{ site.phone.display }}</a>
            <a href="/#quote" class="btn btn-lg" data-quote-open data-en="Get a Free Quote →" data-es="Obtener Cotización →">Get a Free Quote →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
{% endblock %}
